    <!-- How to play -->
    <string name="howto_intro">Four players. Thirteen regions of four countries. Collect the most regions to win!</string>
    <string name="howto_step1_title">You get 13 cards</string>
    <string name="howto_step1_body">Every card is a country, with its flag, capital city, language and money.</string>
    <string name="howto_step2_title">Every country is in a region of 4</string>
    <string name="howto_step2_body">Sweden, Norway, Denmark and Finland make the Nordic Countries region. Your cards are sorted into regions for you.</string>
    <string name="howto_step3_title">Ask another player for a card</string>
    <string name="howto_step3_body">Pick a region you have started, choose a country you still need, and ask one player for it.</string>
    <string name="howto_step4_title">Right guess? Go again</string>
    <string name="howto_step4_body">If they have the card, you take it and keep your turn. If they do not, the next player has a turn.</string>
    <string name="howto_step5_title">Collect all 4 to score</string>
    <string name="howto_step5_body">A full region of four is a quartet and scores 1 point. There are 13 to win.</string>
    <string name="howto_example">Example region</string>
    <string name="howto_tip">Tip: the card tells you which countries you still need.</string>

